==Battleground==
*5 [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn after 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Mola]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawns.
**1 [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardine]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**2 [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**2 [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Molas]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**3 [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**3 [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**3 [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Molas]] spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

